WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:03.840
Hello to my Korean

00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:05.520
readers,

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:07.520
and maybe even my publisher.

00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:10.480
I'm sitting here in Maui, Hawaii

00:00:11.259 --> 00:00:14.729
taking a bit of a break from my tour and I just received word that

00:00:15.549 --> 00:00:22.768
sales of 12 rules for life in Korea are approaching the hundred thousand mark, so I'm extremely gratified to hear that

00:00:24.369 --> 00:00:29.729
I'm a great admirer of South Korean culture. I think that what you

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:36.239
your people have managed in the last 40 years is nothing short of a miracle and

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:40.829
Filled with admiration for your accomplishments

00:00:41.710 --> 00:00:46.919
I would really hope that twelve rules for life can help you people

00:00:47.559 --> 00:00:49.559
young and old alike

00:00:50.649 --> 00:00:56.159
and encourage them to develop a compelling vision for their life and to take on this sort of

00:00:56.559 --> 00:00:59.399
responsibility that you've been masters at managing

00:00:59.890 --> 00:01:06.900
And to speak honestly and forthrightly and to live nobly and to bury your suffering properly and to help make the world

00:01:07.330 --> 00:01:09.330
better and less malevolent place

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:11.560
and so

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:17.729
thank you for all your support so far and I hope at some point to be able to come to your country and perhaps

00:01:18.549 --> 00:01:20.409
Talk to you

00:01:20.409 --> 00:01:22.240
Thanks very much

00:01:22.240 --> 00:01:24.240
Dr. Jordan Peterson.

00:01:25.160 --> 00:01:25.720
Bye bye.

